    "updated_at": "2016-03-06T00:29:03Z",
    "body": "You’ll notice that the entire paragraph stating this requirement is actually now marked `class=nodev` and so won’t show up in the developer output at all. That seems like a bug though I see that @Hixie made it that way intentionally in https://github.com/whatwg/html/commit/d8c6447c. But I propose that at this point we revert that and make it show up in the dev output again, and follow up to with @Hixie to confirm.\n",
